  </head>
  <body class="min-h-dvh font-sans text-ink antialiased{% if request.path contains '/policies/shipping-policy' %} zh-shipping-policy{% endif %}{% if request.path contains '/policies/refund-policy' %} zh-refund-policy{% endif %}">
    <a class="sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:absolute focus:left-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-50 focus:rounded focus:bg-surface focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-ink focus:shadow" href="#MainContent">{{ 'general.accessibility.skip_to_content' | t }}</a>

    {% sections 'header-group' %}

    <main id="MainContent" role="main">
      {%- if request.path contains '/policies/shipping-policy' -%}
        <article class="zh-shipping-page" aria-labelledby="zh-shipping-title">
          <div class="zh-shipping-page__inner">
            <header class="zh-shipping-header">
              <p class="zh-shipping-eyebrow">Klantenservice</p>
              <h1 id="zh-shipping-title" class="zh-shipping-title">Verzending</h1>
              <p class="zh-shipping-intro">
                Je bestelling wordt vanuit Nederland verzonden en zorgvuldig verpakt.
              </p>
              <p class="zh-shipping-intro">
                Hier lees je meer over levering, kosten en wat je kunt doen <span class="zh-nowrap">bij schade</span>.
              </p>
            </header>

            <section class="zh-shipping-summary" aria-label="Verzending in het kort">
              <p class="zh-shipping-summary__heading">In het kort</p>
              <dl>
                <div class="zh-shipping-summary__row">
                  <dt>Levertijd</dt>
                  <dd>Meestal <span class="zh-nowrap">1–3 werkdagen</span>.</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="zh-shipping-summary__row">
                  <dt>Gratis verzending</dt>
                  <dd>Binnen Nederland vanaf <span class="zh-nowrap">€100</span>.</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="zh-shipping-summary__row">
                  <dt>Verzendgebied</dt>
                  <dd>Nederland, België, Duitsland en Frankrijk.</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="zh-shipping-summary__row">
                  <dt>Track &amp; trace</dt>
                  <dd>Je ontvangt deze na verzending.</dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </section>

            <div class="zh-shipping-sections">
              <section class="zh-shipping-section">
                <h2>Verzendkosten</h2>
                <p>
                  Je ziet de verzendkosten altijd voordat je bestelt.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Binnen Nederland verzenden we gratis vanaf <span class="zh-nowrap">€100</span>.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Voor België, Duitsland en Frankrijk zie je het tarief voordat je bestelt.
                </p>
              </section>

              <section class="zh-shipping-section">
                <h2>Levertijd en bezorging</h2>
                <p>
                  We verwerken je bestelling zorgvuldig.
                </p>
                <p>
                  De verwachte levertijd is meestal <span class="zh-nowrap">1–3 werkdagen</span>.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Na verzending ontvang je de track &amp; trace.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Is er vertraging bij de vervoerder? Dan kijken we graag mee.
                </p>
              </section>

              <section class="zh-shipping-section">
                <h2>Adresgegevens</h2>
                <p>
                  Controleer je adres goed voordat je bestelt. Zo voorkom je vertraging.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Komt je pakket retour door een fout adres? Of is het niet opgehaald? Dan kunnen extra kosten ontstaan.
                </p>
              </section>

              <section class="zh-shipping-section zh-shipping-section--damage">
                <h2>Schade of breuk</h2>
                <p>
                  Veel producten van <span class="zh-nowrap">Zayna Home</span> zijn breekbaar. Daarom verpakken we je bestelling extra zorgvuldig.
                </p>

                <div class="zh-shipping-damage-actions" aria-label="Wat te doen bij schade">
                  <div class="zh-shipping-action">
                    <strong>Mail ons</strong>
                    <span>Bij voorkeur binnen 48 uur via <a href="mailto:info@zaynahome.nl">info@zaynahome.nl</a>.</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="zh-shipping-action">
                    <strong>Stuur foto’s mee</strong>
                    <span>Van de verpakking, het verzendlabel en het product.</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="zh-shipping-action">
                    <strong>Bewaar de verpakking</strong>
                    <span>Tot we je melding hebben bekeken.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <p class="zh-shipping-damage-note">
                  Meld je het later? Dan kijken we nog steeds mee. De beoordeling kan dan wel iets lastiger zijn.
                </p>
              </section>

              <p class="zh-shipping-closing">
                Twijfel je over je levering? Mail ons gerust via <a href="mailto:info@zaynahome.nl">info@zaynahome.nl</a>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      {%- elsif request.path contains '/policies/refund-policy' -%}
        <article class="zh-refund-page" aria-labelledby="zh-refund-title">
          <div class="zh-refund-page__inner">
            <header class="zh-refund-header">
              <p class="zh-refund-eyebrow">Klantenservice</p>
              <h1 id="zh-refund-title" class="zh-refund-title">Retourneren</h1>
              <p class="zh-refund-intro">
                Niet helemaal tevreden met je bestelling? Je kunt je bestelling binnen <span class="zh-nowrap">14 dagen</span> na ontvangst aanmelden voor retour.
              </p>
              <p class="zh-refund-intro">
                Hier lees je hoe retourneren werkt, waar je pakket aan moet voldoen en hoe je breekbare producten veilig terugstuurt.
              </p>
            </header>

            <section class="zh-refund-summary" aria-label="Retourneren in het kort">
              <p class="zh-refund-summary__heading">In het kort</p>
              <dl>
                <div class="zh-refund-summary__row">
                  <dt>Bedenktijd</dt>
                  <dd>Aanmelden binnen <span class="zh-nowrap">14 dagen</span> na ontvangst.</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="zh-refund-summary__row">
                  <dt>Terugsturen</dt>
                  <dd>Binnen <span class="zh-nowrap">14 dagen</span> na je retourmelding.</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="zh-refund-summary__row">
                  <dt>Retourkosten</dt>
                  <dd>Voor eigen rekening, tenzij vooraf anders afgesproken.</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="zh-refund-summary__row">
                  <dt>Aanmelden</dt>
                  <dd>Via het <a href="/pages/retour-aanmelden">retourformulier</a> of per <a href="mailto:info@zaynahome.nl">e-mail</a>.</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="zh-refund-summary__row">
                  <dt>Breekbare producten</dt>
                  <dd>Verpak glaswerk en andere breekbare producten zorgvuldig.</dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </section>

            <div class="zh-refund-sections">
              <section class="zh-refund-section">
                <h2>Retour aanmelden</h2>
                <p>
                  Meld je retour aan via het <a href="/pages/retour-aanmelden">retourformulier</a> of via <a href="mailto:info@zaynahome.nl">info@zaynahome.nl</a>. Vermeld daarbij je ordernummer en welke producten je wilt retourneren.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Na je melding ontvang je van ons het retouradres en de verdere retourinstructies. Wil je gebruikmaken van het modelformulier voor herroeping? Mail ons gerust, dan sturen we het mee.
                </p>
                <p>
                  De retourkosten zijn voor eigen rekening, tenzij we vooraf iets anders met je hebben afgesproken of de wet iets anders bepaalt. We raden aan om je retour met <span class="zh-nowrap">track &amp; trace</span> te versturen en het verzendbewijs te bewaren totdat je retour is verwerkt.
                </p>
              </section>

              <section class="zh-refund-section">
                <h2>Staat van het product</h2>
                <p>
                  Je mag het product bekijken en beoordelen zoals je dat in een fysieke winkel zou doen.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Stuur het product compleet, schoon en onbeschadigd terug. Gebruik indien mogelijk de originele verpakking.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Is een product beschadigd, incompleet of meer gebruikt dan nodig om het te beoordelen? Dan kan dit invloed hebben op het bedrag dat wordt terugbetaald.
                </p>
              </section>

              <section class="zh-refund-section zh-refund-section--care">
                <h2>Glas en breekbare producten</h2>
                <p>
                  Veel producten van <span class="zh-nowrap">Zayna Home</span> zijn gemaakt van glas of ander breekbaar materiaal. Verpak deze producten daarom zorgvuldig en stevig wanneer je ze terugstuurt.
                </p>

                <div class="zh-refund-care-actions" aria-label="Breekbare producten retourneren">
                  <div class="zh-refund-action">
                    <strong>Gebruik de originele verpakking</strong>
                    <span>Gebruik bij voorkeur de originele doos en het beschermingsmateriaal.</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="zh-refund-action">
                    <strong>Verpak glas apart</strong>
                    <span>Zorg dat glaswerk en andere breekbare producten niet kunnen schuiven.</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="zh-refund-action">
                    <strong>Vul lege ruimte goed op</strong>
                    <span>Gebruik voldoende opvulmateriaal aan alle kanten.</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="zh-refund-action">
                    <strong>Bewaar het verzendbewijs</strong>
                    <span>Bewaar dit totdat je retour volledig is verwerkt. Maak bij voorkeur ook foto’s van de verpakking.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <p class="zh-refund-note">
                  Komt een retour beschadigd bij ons aan, dan bekijken we zorgvuldig wat er is gebeurd. Blijkt dat het product onvoldoende of onzorgvuldig is verpakt, dan kan dit invloed hebben op het bedrag dat wordt terugbetaald.
                </p>
              </section>

              <section class="zh-refund-section">
                <h2>Terugbetaling</h2>
                <p>
                  Na je herroepingsmelding betalen we het verschuldigde bedrag zo snel mogelijk terug via de oorspronkelijke betaalmethode.
                </p>
                <p>
                  We betalen uiterlijk binnen <span class="zh-nowrap">14 dagen</span> na je herroepingsmelding terug. We mogen wachten met terugbetalen totdat we het product hebben ontvangen of totdat je hebt aangetoond dat het product is teruggezonden.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Retourneer je de volledige bestelling? Dan betalen we ook de betaalde standaard heenzendkosten terug volgens de wettelijke regels. Extra kosten voor een duurdere verzendmethode worden niet terugbetaald.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Bij een gedeeltelijke retour worden de oorspronkelijke heenzendkosten niet terugbetaald, voor zover wettelijk toegestaan. Eventuele waardevermindering verrekenen we met het bedrag dat wordt terugbetaald.
                </p>
              </section>

              <section class="zh-refund-section zh-refund-section--received">
                <h2>Beschadigd of incompleet ontvangen?</h2>
                <p>
                  Is je product beschadigd, gebroken of incompleet aangekomen? Meld dit als schademelding, niet als gewone retour. Dan kunnen we goed beoordelen wat er is gebeurd.
                </p>

                <div class="zh-refund-received-actions" aria-label="Wat te doen bij schade na ontvangst">
                  <div class="zh-refund-action">
                    <strong>Controleer je bestelling</strong>
                    <span>Doe dit bij voorkeur direct na ontvangst.</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="zh-refund-action">
                    <strong>Meld de schade</strong>
                    <span>Bij voorkeur binnen <span class="zh-nowrap">48 uur</span>. Mail naar <a href="mailto:info@zaynahome.nl">info@zaynahome.nl</a>.</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="zh-refund-action">
                    <strong>Stuur foto’s mee</strong>
                    <span>Van de buitenverpakking, het verzendlabel, het beschermingsmateriaal en het beschadigde product.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <p class="zh-refund-note">
                  We bekijken je melding zorgvuldig. Als dat passend is, zoeken we een oplossing, zoals een vervangend product of een gedeeltelijke terugbetaling.
                </p>
              </section>

              <p class="zh-refund-closing">
                Twijfel je over je retour? Mail ons gerust via <a href="mailto:info@zaynahome.nl">info@zaynahome.nl</a>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      {%- else -%}
        {{ content_for_layout }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </main>

    {% sections 'footer-group' %}

    {%- capture mobile_body -%}{% render 'mobile-menu' %}{%- endcapture -%}
    {% render 'aside', type: 'mobile', heading: shop.name, aside_body: mobile_body %}

    {%- capture search_heading -%}{{ 'general.search.title' | t }}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture search_body -%}
      <div class="zayna-search-panel">
        <form
          action="{{ routes.search_url }}"
          method="get"
          role="search"
          class="zayna-search-form"
          data-predictive-form
          data-predictive-url="{{ routes.predictive_search_url }}"
          data-min-chars="2"
        >
          <label class="sr-only" for="ZaynaSearchInput">
            {{ 'general.search.title' | t }}
          </label>

          <div class="zayna-search-field">
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="zayna-search-icon"
            >
              {% render 'icon', name: 'search', size: 20 %}
            </span>

            <input
              id="ZaynaSearchInput"
              type="search"
              name="q"
              data-predictive-input
              data-aside-autofocus
              placeholder="{{ 'general.search.placeholder' | t }}"
              autocomplete="off"
              autocorrect="off"
              autocapitalize="off"
              spellcheck="false"
              enterkeyhint="search"
              role="combobox"
              aria-autocomplete="list"
              aria-controls="ZaynaPredictiveResults"
              aria-expanded="false"
              class="zayna-search-input"
            >
          </div>

          <input type="hidden" name="type" value="product,page,article">

          <button
            type="submit"
            class="zayna-search-submit"
          >
            {{ 'general.search.submit' | t }}
          </button>
        </form>

        <div
          id="ZaynaPredictiveResults"
          class="zayna-search-results"
          data-predictive-results
          aria-live="polite"
          aria-atomic="false"
        >
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">
            {{ 'general.search.start_typing' | t }}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endcapture -%}
    {% render 'aside', type: 'search', heading: search_heading, aside_body: search_body %}

    {% style %}
      [data-aside="search"] {
        --zh-search-bg: #fffdfb;
        --zh-search-ink: #2a2520;
        --zh-search-soft: #625951;
        --zh-search-muted: #857a71;
        --zh-search-border: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.10);
        --zh-search-border-strong: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.16);
        --zh-search-cream: #f3ece4;
        --zh-search-clay: #96613f;
        --zh-search-added: #efe5dc;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-panel {
        padding: 16px 18px 26px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-form {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 10px;
        width: 100%;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-field {
        display: flex;
        min-width: 0;
        min-height: 48px;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--zh-search-border-strong);
        transition: border-color 180ms ease;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-field:focus-within {
        border-color: var(--zh-search-clay);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        color: var(--zh-search-muted);
        transition: color 180ms ease;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-field:focus-within .zayna-search-icon {
        color: var(--zh-search-clay);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-input {
        width: 100%;
        min-width: 0;
        min-height: 46px;
        padding: 11px 0;
        border: 0;
        outline: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--zh-search-ink);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.4;
        -webkit-appearance: none;
        appearance: none;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-input::placeholder {
        color: #81776f;
        opacity: 1;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-submit {
        display: none;
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 42px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 0 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--zh-search-border-strong);
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--zh-search-ink);
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: 0.16em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition:
          background-color 180ms ease,
          border-color 180ms ease,
          color 180ms ease;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-submit:hover {
        border-color: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.30);
        background: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.92);
        color: #fffdfb;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-submit:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--zh-search-clay);
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-results {
        margin-top: 15px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-results.is-refreshing .zh-predictive-results {
        opacity: 0.58;
        transition: opacity 140ms ease;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-results a,
      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-results button {
        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-results a {
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-results a:focus-visible,
      [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-results button:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--zh-search-clay);
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-predictive-results__stack {
        display: grid;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-section__heading {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 7px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-section__heading span:first-child {
        color: #90867d;
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.20em;
        line-height: 1;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-section__heading span:last-child {
        height: 1px;
        flex: 1 1 auto;
        background: var(--zh-search-border);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-products,
      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-link-list {
        display: grid;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--zh-search-border);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__inner {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
        padding: 9px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--zh-search-border);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__main {
        display: flex;
        min-width: 0;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__image-wrap,
      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-link-row__image-wrap {
        display: block;
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: var(--zh-search-cream);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__image-wrap {
        width: 58px;
        height: 58px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.055);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__image,
      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-link-row__image {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__copy {
        display: grid;
        min-width: 0;
        gap: 3px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__title {
        display: -webkit-box;
        overflow: hidden;
        color: var(--zh-search-ink);
        font-family: var(--font-display, Georgia, serif);
        font-size: 14.25px;
        line-height: 1.18;
        letter-spacing: -0.012em;
        -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
        -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
        transition: color 180ms ease;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__main:hover .zh-search-product__title {
        color: var(--zh-search-clay);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__price {
        color: var(--zh-search-soft);
        font-size: 12.25px;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__status {
        color: var(--zh-search-muted);
        font-size: 11.5px;
        line-height: 1.25;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__action {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: flex-end;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__form {
        margin: 0;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button {
        display: inline-flex;
        min-width: 74px;
        min-height: 31px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0;
        padding: 0 10px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.13);
        background: rgba(255, 253, 251, 0.62);
        color: var(--zh-search-ink);
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 400;
        letter-spacing: 0.01em;
        line-height: 1;
        text-align: center;
        text-decoration: none;
        text-transform: none;
        white-space: nowrap;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition:
          background-color 180ms ease,
          border-color 180ms ease,
          color 180ms ease,
          opacity 180ms ease;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button:hover {
        border-color: rgba(150, 97, 63, 0.24);
        background: rgba(244, 238, 232, 0.72);
        color: #2a2520;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button[disabled] {
        cursor: wait;
        opacity: 0.72;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button.is-added {
        border-color: rgba(159, 99, 61, 0.26);
        background: var(--zh-search-added);
        color: #5f554d;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button.is-error {
        border-color: rgba(178, 58, 72, 0.28);
        background: rgba(178, 58, 72, 0.06);
        color: #8c3c43;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button--option {
        border-color: rgba(150, 97, 63, 0.20);
        color: #704a33;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button--sold {
        justify-content: center;
        border-color: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.10);
        color: #9a8f85;
        cursor: default;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button--sold:hover {
        border-color: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.10);
        background: transparent;
        color: #9a8f85;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-link-row {
        display: flex;
        min-height: 64px;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 9px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--zh-search-border);
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-link-row--text {
        min-height: 48px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-link-row__image-wrap {
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-link-row__title {
        min-width: 0;
        flex: 1 1 auto;
        overflow: hidden;
        color: var(--zh-search-ink);
        font-family: var(--font-display, Georgia, serif);
        font-size: 14.5px;
        line-height: 1.22;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        white-space: nowrap;
        transition: color 180ms ease;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-link-row:hover .zh-search-link-row__title {
        color: var(--zh-search-clay);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-link-row__arrow {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        color: #9d9288;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-view-all,
      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-empty-state__link {
        display: inline-flex;
        min-height: 40px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 0 15px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(159, 99, 61, 0.24);
        background: rgba(244, 238, 232, 0.60);
        color: #704a33;
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        line-height: 1;
        text-decoration: none;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-view-all {
        width: 100%;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-empty-state,
      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-message,
      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-status {
        padding: 28px 8px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-empty-state__title,
      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-message__title {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--zh-search-ink);
        font-family: var(--font-display, Georgia, serif);
        font-size: 18.5px;
        line-height: 1.18;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-empty-state__text,
      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-message__text,
      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-status {
        margin: 8px auto 0;
        max-width: 32ch;
        color: var(--zh-search-soft);
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.58;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-empty-state__link {
        margin-top: 15px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-empty-state__choices {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 8px;
        width: min(100%, 310px);
        margin: 18px auto 0;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-empty-state__choice {
        display: inline-flex;
        min-height: 40px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 0 14px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(150, 97, 63, 0.22);
        background: rgba(244, 238, 232, 0.58);
        color: #704a33;
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        line-height: 1;
        text-decoration: none;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-empty-state__choice:hover {
        border-color: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.30);
        background: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.92);
        color: #fffdfb;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton {
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton__label {
        display: block;
        width: 112px;
        height: 10px;
        background: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.08);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton ul {
        display: grid;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--zh-search-border);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton__row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 10px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--zh-search-border);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton__image {
        width: 58px;
        height: 58px;
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        background: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.07);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton__copy {
        display: grid;
        flex: 1 1 auto;
        gap: 9px;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton__line {
        display: block;
        height: 10px;
        background: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.07);
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton__line--wide {
        width: 78%;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton__line--short {
        width: 42%;
      }

      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton.is-animated .zh-search-skeleton__label,
      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton.is-animated .zh-search-skeleton__image,
      [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton.is-animated .zh-search-skeleton__line {
        animation: zhSearchPulse 1.45s ease-in-out infinite;
      }

      @keyframes zhSearchPulse {
        0%, 100% { opacity: 0.34; }
        50% { opacity: 0.62; }
      }

      @media (max-width: 374px) {
        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__inner {
          grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        }

        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__action {
          justify-content: stretch;
          padding-left: 70px;
        }

        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button,
        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__form {
          width: 100%;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 759px) {
        [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-submit {
          display: none !important;
        }

        [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-form {
          gap: 0;
        }

        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button:hover {
          border-color: rgba(42, 37, 32, 0.13);
          background: rgba(255, 253, 251, 0.62);
          color: var(--zh-search-ink);
        }

        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button.is-added:hover {
          border-color: rgba(159, 99, 61, 0.26);
          background: var(--zh-search-added);
          color: #5f554d;
        }
      }

      @media (min-width: 760px) {
        [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-panel {
          padding-right: 24px;
          padding-left: 24px;
        }

        [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-form {
          grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
          align-items: end;
        }

        [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-submit {
          display: inline-flex;
          width: auto;
          min-width: 112px;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-field,
        [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-icon,
        [data-aside="search"] .zayna-search-submit,
        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__button,
        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-link-row__title,
        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-product__title {
          transition: none;
        }

        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton.is-animated .zh-search-skeleton__label,
        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton.is-animated .zh-search-skeleton__image,
        [data-aside="search"] .zh-search-skeleton.is-animated .zh-search-skeleton__line {
          animation: none;
        }
      }
    {% endstyle %}

    <script src="{{ 'search.js' | asset_url | append: '?zh=8' }}" defer></script>

    {% section 'cart-drawer' %}
  </body>
</html>